<li>MITRE: <a href="https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/400.html">CWE-400: Uncontrolled Resource Consumption</a>.</li>
<li>Go documentation: <a href="https://pkg.go.dev/net/http#Server">http.Server</a>.</li>
<li>Cloudflare: <a href="https://blog.cloudflare.com/the-complete-guide-to-golang-net-http-timeouts/">The complete guide to Go net/http timeouts</a>.</li>
</references>
</qhelp>
